WEBVTT

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.210
My, my, if it isn't the great King Satan--

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.720
--or should I call you Sadao Maou now?

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.800
Hero Emilia, long time no see!

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.140
Lucifer?!

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:20.560
Emilia, we're on our way!

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:24.400
Looks like we've got an emergency here.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.610
Did you really get Gate-sick?

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:33.150
S-Sorry.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.990
Make it quick, please.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:52.630
<i>Right here, this moment,</i> <i>this is our starting point</i>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:58.680
<i>Let's picture what we might be able to do</i>

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:02.730
<i>Unbelievable things can happen sometimes</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:08.440
<i>More... we can push past this</i>

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:19.330
<i>Everything is born from zero;</i>
<i>I want to shine, flap my wings hard</i>

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.790
<i>And fly to that sky</i>

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:30.960
<i>Come on, let's go, with</i> <i>brilliant smiles on our faces!</i>

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:36.760
<i>Let's fly off to an unknown world right now</i>

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>I decide, I'm the one who chooses my future</i>

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.810
<i>Let's follow our dreams</i>

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.350
<i>Sure, some days we'll cry</i>

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:51.650
<i>It's a precious wish, don't disappear</i>

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:59.570
<i>I'm going after the future you,</i> <i>because I know I'll find you</i>

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:13.800
How? I remember running my sacred sword through your chest!

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:27.100
A good question. How <i>am</i> I here?

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.860
Is it thanks to the new friend hiding over there?

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:37.400
One of the six high priests of the Church. Show yourself, already...

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.200
...Olba Mayer!

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.240
Olba?

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:46.750
You were the one behind Emi when she came through the Gate, right?

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:50.210
When I heard that,
I pretty much figured things out.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:56.260
You're the only one who could put one over on me or Emi.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.300
All right, you're on to me.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.140
You look well, Emilia.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.470
Olba...

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:11.060
No... Why are you working with Lucifer?!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.860
You want to know? Fine, it'll be the last thing you ever hear.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:18.400
You figured, "We don't want the hero getting power after she ousts the demon army,

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.780
so let's secretly execute her and steal her authority!"

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:23.320
Right?

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:27.370
And you got Lucifer on your side by promising to restore him to Heaven.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.870
--H-How did you know?!
--Oh, please!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.380
That's the oldest story in the book!

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.960
And who says "the last thing you ever hear" anymore?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:40.760
Even B movies get better scripting than that, Baldy!

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:45.260
B-B-Baldy... B movie... "B movie"?!

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:49.390
Hold on a moment, Sire. I cannot let that slide.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.190
When exactly did you waste money on a <i>movie</i>?

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.860
Wh-What's the big deal?
I pay for 'em with my allowance.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.320
While all this time I've been forcing myself

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.030
not to take a break from housekeeping and have fun like I want to!

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.360
I'm reducing your allowance, Sire!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.120
You're going there?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.080
--You're really going there?! I see how it is!
--Knock it off!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.120
Ashiya!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.330
Okay, the farce is over.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:19.340
Sorry, but I'm closing the curtain early.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:25.430
Sire... At least watch them on the 1st of the month... It's discount day...

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:29.720
Don't talk, Ashiya!
Also, that info's not important right now!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.810
All right, shall I do Emilia next?

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.270
Or King Satan?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:39.190
Eh, too much work! I'll do both at once.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:52.000
My first taste of destruction since I lost to the hero Emilia!

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:55.040
Who knew it would be so delicious?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.540
Lucifer!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:01.800
Relax. It's not like they can put up much resistance.

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:06.390
Running away with your tail between your legs?! What a slacker!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.970
Shut up, you! Helping Ashiya comes first!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:16.310
Anyway, how can Lucifer use so much magic in this world?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.820
He's feeding off of negative human emotions.

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:19.770
What?

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:24.320
They're the ones who held up all those convenience stores.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.070
What? Why would they--

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.410
For despair, fear, sadness.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.700
To absorb magic from the negative emotions people feel

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.080
in extreme situations.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:37.080
A normal person would be scared enough to pee his pants

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.340
if a demon like that attacked him, right?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.590
That's the source of his magic.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.590
Oh, you figured that out, Sire?

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.890
Only thanks to you.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.510
I realized it when we were in the cave-in

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:56.100
and the humans' fear and despair flowed into my body.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.980
<i>That's</i> what returned me to my original form.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.480
Then why haven't you tried to get more magic?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.280
If you filled this world with fear and despair,

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.450
you could have gained enough to come back to Ente Isla.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.370
The thing is, I really like this world.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:16.160
Becoming human's been pretty novel and interesting,

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:20.130
and I don't want to cause this world problems after all it's done for me.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.300
That's not how I want to play this.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:30.680
You've gone soft, Sire. Too soft!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.850
I'll drink first, then.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:39.850
From <i>her</i>! I'll fill up on the energy of her fear and despair, and...

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:40.730
Chiho!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.150
Hey, let Chi go!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.280
What a crime it is to be young.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:51.320
To think trivial things can cause people such despair, such a flood of sorrow!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.530
Run!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:02.670
Plus, her negative emotions about a <i>certain someone</i> are very easy to control!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:11.800
Ow! Human bodies are so fragile!
I mean, I knew that, but <i>damn</i>!

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:15.430
Quit wailing! And you call yourself a ruler of demons?!

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:17.810
Maou!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.850
Olba! You'll even use one of those?

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:26.230
I need to save enough power to control the Gate on my trip home.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.740
You're so weak.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:32.070
Are you really the same demon king who tried to seize all of Ente Isla?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:35.910
Hurry it up. If we act now, we can kill off Emilia with him.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.790
Emi.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.870
--Hang on.
--Huh?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:48.170
So he had enough power left to teleport, at least.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.420
Still...

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:59.310
This is... Koshu Kaido Road?

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.140
We're right by Sasazuka Station!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.310
Why bring us somewhere so crowded?!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:07.280
You'd better not have come back here hoping for an ambulance!

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.610
Of course not! Ow, ow...

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.200
You can't run from me...

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.200
<i>...Sire.</i>

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.290
Lucifer! The longer this drags on, the more witnesses!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.000
You're too uptight, Olba.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:27.960
We can just kill the extra witnesses. But first...

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.640
Maou?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.270
Snap out of it, Maou!

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.850
No...

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:49.030
He can't bounce back from <i>that</i> like he did in Shinjuku!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:52.400
Now that I've defeated the king, I don't need this girl.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.110
You can have her back.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.450
Chiho!

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.580
Olba! I'm fulfilling the contract.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.090
Give me a beautiful chorus to the end,

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:11.590
made from crashing rubble and wails of despair!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:15.090
Stop it, Lucifer! Olba!

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.930
I like your scream.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.460
No way...

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.050
This is...

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:03.140
That's a B movie for you: predictable.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:09.150
Thanks, Lucifer. I've finally managed to get back to this form.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.110
The king!

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:11.520
Satan!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.870
Is that... Mr. Maou?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.580
Chiho...

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:29.630
--Emilia... Emilia the hero! Emi?

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:26.790
--I get it, he brought us back to where the crowds are

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.630
--so he could absorb human despair and fear.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:33.000
--As if Lucifer and Olba weren't hard enough on their own!
--Hey! Hello?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.010
Hey, Emi!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.050
Hmm? M-Me?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.590
Are you kidding me?!
What are you spacing out for?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.350
Hurry up and do something about him!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:47.890
My magic isn't what it was.
It's heavy... Seriously, this is hard!

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.310
You can see I'm slipping...

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.900
Please!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.780
Hurry!

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:02.910
Are you stupid? I've never seen a Devil so lame.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:07.620
Whatever, just do something already! Help out!

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.960
Uh, no, I meant, help me pretty please?!

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.960
I refuse.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:18.090
I'm a hero. I'd die before I lent the Devil a hand!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.470
Even <i>now</i>?!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.930
So...

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.760
...you hold out a little longer.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:28.230
Don't worry, I'll settle this fast.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.440
Miss Yusa?

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:34.320
You'll be safe in there, and it won't hurt.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.690
For some reason, I want you to know about us.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:45.660
Manifest now, my power!
So that we may vanquish evil!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:57.210
Manifest now, my power!
So that we may vanquish evil!

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.590
Celestial force?

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:13.230
I am a hero. The world may change, but that fact never will!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.560
Oho, cool line!

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:16.520
Be quiet!

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:20.900
After I take them down, you're next! So you just be ready!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:25.120
Fast as you can, please. But first--

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:33.290
What did you do?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.380
I put up a magical barrier.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.670
Now you can fight all-out without inconveniencing anyone, right?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.340
Hmph.

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:47.640
Well... maybe I'll have to go at you full-strength now, too!

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:52.440
Sorry.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.400
What was that for?!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.650
I'll never forgive you, Lucifer!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:20.630
How did you plan to defeat me, when you can't recover your celestial force?

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:25.260
What's so funny?

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.720
I certainly don't want to battle alongside a <i>hero,</i>

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.390
but I've sworn my allegiance to King Satan.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.850
Alciel!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:37.560
Which makes you my current enemy, Lucifer!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.400
You're okay after all?

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:45.070
His Majesty mercifully gave me enough magic to return from death's door.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.700
Where have you been, then?

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:51.040
I went back to the apartment to pick up my general's cape!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:57.290
I'm not thanking you.
Something like that wouldn't even hurt me.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:02.340
If you can still say that after learning human frailty, you're really something.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.670
Useless wretch!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:08.340
If you're one of the humans who held the Devil at bay, then <i>fight</i> like it!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.260
I don't have a way to replenish my celestial force.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:15.310
--If I use it all up, I can't go home!
--The same goes for if you lose!

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:24.030
Is it just me, or am I and my role in this way too drab right now?

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:31.370
This isn't a movie, is it...?

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:38.250
There's no explaining away this one, huh?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.880
Holy Flame Slice!

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:48.840
Lucifer!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:08.110
E-Emilia... Are you out of your mind, joining forces with demons?

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.860
--You're one to talk!
--I don't want to hear that from <i>you</i>!
--You're one to talk, Baldy!

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.760
Man, that was heavy! <i>Really</i> heavy!

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:36.310
But still, great work, self!
You put it down gently! So it's all good!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.770
King Satan...!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:43.900
Shall we wrap this up quick?
We'll be late for work at this rate.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:48.820
And I did promise to teach you how to service the ice cream machine today.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.870
As for you...

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:58.830
You've got some nerve to force me, ruler of worlds, into a drab role.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.960
How shall I punish you?

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.750
D-Damn it!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:08.880
Huh?!

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:17.350
Hey, Emi. What do you think
I should do with this guy?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:22.350
Let's see. For starters, how about punishing him for wrecking the neighborhood?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:27.690
Good idea. Oh, and Lucifer, if I'm late to work today, it's <i>your</i> fault.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.610
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:34.200
How do you plan to repay me if
I lose my perfect attendance bonus?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:37.790
He's talking about something eternally beyond your understanding or mine.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:43.870
You're a great demon general, so face your doom like a man.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.250
Clench your teeth!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:03.520
Um... it seems a little late for me to ask this, but...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.810
Well... what are you guys?

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:09.400
I feel a little shy when you come right out and ask me,

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:13.650
but I'm a demon king in another world.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.570
You don't believe me, do you!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:22.410
N-No, I believe you! I mean,
I saw you do amazing things, so...

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.750
Nah, that was nothing!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:29.880
Sire, while modesty is a virtue in Japan, in this case I suggest bragging.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:33.880
I'm a human, got it?
Well, one with half angel blood.

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:34.550
Huh?!

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.390
Really, you're half-angel?!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.810
Why would that shock you? You're a demon king!

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:42.520
Hey! Chiho!

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:46.730
I'm sorry! I always thought angels and demons and stuff were more...

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.480
...like, imaginary and amazing.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:54.900
True, who'd picture a ruler of demons working at MgRonald's?

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.530
I won't take that from a hero working at a call center!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:58.910
Excuse me?!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:04.160
Anyway, how come you've never attacked me, if you had that much power left?

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:09.330
Because you might've been faking not having any power, like the coward you are.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:14.470
Plus I had to save enough to get back through the Gate.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:20.140
So he and I could never be in a romantic relationship, so you can rest easy.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.510
M-Miss Yusa!

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.810
So, what are you going to do?

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:28.770
You got your magic back.
Will you head back to Ente Isla now?

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:32.320
Nah, I'm down for a ton of shifts at work this month.

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.490
Which is more important to you, Sire,

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:37.490
the subjugation of Ente Isla or a part-time job at MgRonald's?!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:38.360
What?

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.870
--E-Excuse me... What should I do?
--Come on, we still haven't won first in the district for fair goods sales--

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.870
--That reminds me, Lucifer,
--Please focus more on Ente Isla than the Hatagaya district!

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.040
--were you the one who called me at work?
--We just bought the fridge and the washing machine, too.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.580
--Do you think we need to depend on appliances now that we have magic again?!

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.870
--Yeah, I was.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.580
--How did you find me?

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.790
--Well...
--But--

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.300
But me no buts!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.380
It's... my wallet!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:01.890
Lucifer, did you seriously look inside a woman's wallet without asking?

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:02.930
He's scum.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:05.430
Clench your teeth!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:10.310
Huh? Why's this place frozen?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.400
A magical barrier.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.110
Emilia!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:16.940
Emerada?!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.700
Albert!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:21.990
You guys are late.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.370
Wait.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.160
Are you King Satan?

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:30.080
And are you Alciel?

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:31.170
Correct!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:32.880
Tremble with fear!

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:37.420
Anyway, it's not just Olba.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:41.050
The whole Church was in on it.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:45.470
Is it really a good idea to leave
Satan and the others alone?

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:49.850
He said to head back to the Devil's Castle, so let's let them clean up.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.480
And <i>that's</i> the Devil's Castle.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.020
Huh?!

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:58.360
Emilia... It's so...

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:00.990
Believe me, I know.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.530
Okay, then...

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.870
You really won't regret this, will you, Sire?

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.330
Nope. We can't just leave things the way they are, can we?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.710
Don't tell me we're...

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:16.550
His Highness has spoken, and that's all there is to it.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:20.380
What the hell is with you two?

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:21.800
Beats me.

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:25.220
The boss is responsible for his underlings' mistakes.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:29.270
That's as true in Ente Isla as it is at MgRonald's.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.810
The supreme ruler's gotta take on that responsibility!

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:42.610
This magic...

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:58.750
I gotta admit, we sure inconvenienced this world.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:05.340
We shot off sonar pulses like crazy to find Emilia,

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:09.850
so you probably got lots of earthquakes, right?

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:13.940
Wait... Were you the voice I heard in my head?

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.310
You heard that too, Missy?

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.610
What's she talking about?

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:23.820
We set it to broadcast to "people constantly thinking about King Satan."

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:29.280
Wow, I never knew Satan was such a smooth operator.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.950
We're home!

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.880
All set!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:46.220
Okay! Can't be gone too long, or the Church will get away with too much.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:50.560
It'd be a big help if you'd come home soon, too...

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:52.520
Yes.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:57.100
Still, there were zero fatalities, the city's back to normal,

00:21:57.310 --> 00:22:00.320
and apparently nobody remembers yesterday.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:03.440
He's really something!

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:06.780
Is he really the demon king?

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.990
Thank you very much!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:15.290
Mr. Maou...

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:21.000
Mr. Maou... are you going home?

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.880
Nope, I'm not.

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:25.920
More like I <i>can't.</i>

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:30.850
I used up a ton of power rebuilding the neighborhood.

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:33.850
I do still have a little left, though.

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:39.520
Say, Chi... It's enough to erase your bad memories, too, so--

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:45.280
--You're an idiot!
--Right!

00:22:45.570 --> 00:22:50.700
<i>I wish for you not to vanish</i>

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:55.950
<i>You smile and tell me you won't</i>

00:22:56.160 --> 00:23:04.840
<i>When I reach out my hand</i>

00:22:56.160 --> 00:23:04.840
<i>to make sure, it pays off</i>

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>You're still there</i>

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:18.260
<i>If we can get even a little</i>

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:18.260
<i>far away before the sun rises</i>

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:28.810
<i>Play me more, more, before the dream ends</i>

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:45.960
"The Devil Climbs the Stairway to School"
